# Exam track — Theme: Vacation & Travel — Sub-lesson 1: Vocabulary
# Sproochentest oral-exam topic. Target level ~B1 (authoring guideline only).
# The manifest id (vacation.01) is the authoritative identity; V1.01 is a label.
#
# Every sub-lesson mixes words AND sentences so each session alternates
# word-match and sentence-builder slots; the emphasis here is vocabulary.

@lesson V1.01 "Vacation Vocabulary"

# --- Travel & transport ---
@word d'Vakanz = vacation
@word d'Rees = trip
@word Reesen = trips
@word de Fliger = airplane
@word den Zuch = train
@word de Bus = bus
@word d'Auto = car
@word de Fluchhafen = airport
@word d'Gare = train station
@word den Ticket = ticket
@word de Pass = passport
@word d'Valise = suitcase
@word d'Grenz = border
@word d'Ausland = abroad

# --- Places & nature ---
@word d'Plage = beach
@word d'Mier = sea
@word de Séi = lake
@word de Bierg = mountain
@word d'Bierger = mountains
@word d'Land = country
@word d'Stad = city
@word den Hotel = hotel
@word de Camping = campsite
@word d'Zelt = tent
@word d'Landschaft = landscape

# --- Weather & time ---
@word d'Sonn = sun
@word d'Wieder = weather
@word de Reen = rain
@word waarm = warm
@word kal = cold
@word d'Woch = week
@word de Mount = month

# --- Doing things ---
@word reesen = to travel
@word fléien = to fly
@word buchen = to book
@word schwammen = to swim
@word besichen = to visit
@word wanderen = to hike
@word d'Foto = photo
@word d'Erënnerung = memory

@sentence
@lu Ech fuere gär op d'Mier.
@en I like going to the sea.
@distractor-lu Bierg
@distractor-lu schaffen
@distractor-en mountain
@distractor-en work

@sentence
@lu Am Summer ass d'Wieder waarm.
@en In summer the weather is warm.
@distractor-lu Wanter
@distractor-lu kal
@distractor-en winter
@distractor-en cold

@sentence
@lu Mir schlofen an engem Zelt um Camping.
@en We sleep in a tent at the campsite.
@distractor-lu Hotel
@distractor-lu iessen
@distractor-en hotel
@distractor-en eat
